<title>USA: Uranium Resources files for up to 1.7 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Uranium Resources files for up to 1.7 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uranium Resources Inc filed Monday with the Securities and Exchange Commission for an offering of a minimum of 1.4 million and a maximum of 1.7 million common shares.</p>
<p>The Denver-based uranium mining company said the shares are being offered principally to institutional investors through EVEREN Securities Inc as placement agent.</p>
<p>It said net proceeds will be used to fund its capital requirements for 1997 and to repay debt.</p>
</text>
